      "name": "Hooked Media IT - Password Expiration Notice",
      "envelope_sender": "Hooked Media IT Security <itsecurity@hookedmedia.example>",
      "subject": "Action Required: Your HookedID password expires in 24 hours",
      "text": "Hi {{.FirstName}},\n\nOur records show the password for your HookedID will expire soon. To avoid losing access to your email, calendar, and shared drives, please reset it now:\n\n{{.URL}}\n\nAccount: {{.Email}}\nExpires: within 24 hours\n\nThis is an automated message from Hooked Media IT Security. If you did not expect this email, contact the Service Desk at extension 4100.",
      "html": "<html>\n<body style=\"margin:0; padding:0; background-color:#f1f5f9;\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"background-color:#f1f5f9;\">\n<tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:40px 16px;\">\n\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"600\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:600px; max-width:100%; background-color:#ffffff; border-radius:8px; overflow:hidden; font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n\n\t<tr>\n\t\t<td style=\"background-color:#0f3d3a; padding:22px 32px;\">\n\t\t\t<span style=\"color:#ffffff; font-size:16px; font-weight:bold; letter-spacing:0.04em;\">HOOKED MEDIA CO.</span>\n\t\t\t<span style=\"color:#7fd6c4; font-size:13px; margin-left:10px;\">IT Security</span>\n\t\t</td>\n\t</tr>\n\n\t<tr>\n\t\t<td style=\"padding:32px 32px 8px;\">\n\t\t\t<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px; font-size:15px; color:#0f172a;\">Hi {{.FirstName}},</p>\n\t\t\t<p style=\"margin:0 0 20px; font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#334155;\">\n\t\t\t\tOur records show the password for your HookedID will expire soon. To avoid\n\t\t\t\tlosing access to your email, calendar, and shared drives, please reset it using\n\t\t\t\tthe button below.\n\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t</td>\n\t</tr>\n\n\t<tr>\n\t\t<td style=\"padding:0 32px 20px;\">\n\t\t\t<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"background-color:#fff7ed; border-left:4px solid #f59e0b; border-radius:4px;\">\n\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:14px 18px; font-size:13px; color:#92400e;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong>Account:</strong> {{.Email}}<br>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong>Expires:</strong> within 24 hours\n\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t</table>\n\t\t</td>\n\t</tr>\n\n\t<tr>\n\t\t<td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:8px 32px 28px;\">\n\t\t\t<a href=\"{{.URL}}\" style=\"background-color:#0f766e; color:#ffffff; text-decoration:none; font-size:14px; font-weight:bold; padding:12px 28px; border-radius:6px; display:inline-block;\">Reset My Password</a>\n\t\t</td>\n\t</tr>\n\n\t<tr>\n\t\t<td style=\"padding:20px 32px; border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;\">\n\t\t\t<p style=\"margin:0; font-size:11px; color:#94a3b8;\">This is an automated message from Hooked Media IT Security. If you did not expect this email, contact the Service Desk at extension 4100.</p>\n\t\t</td>\n\t</tr>\n\n</table>\n{{.Tracker}}\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "attachments": []
    },
    {
      "name": "Hooked Media HR - Open Enrollment Deadline",
      "envelope_sender": "Hooked Media HR Benefits <hr-benefits@hookedmedia.example>",
      "subject": "Open Enrollment closes Friday — confirm your benefits elections",
      "text": "Hi {{.FirstName}},\n\nOpen Enrollment for health, dental, and vision benefits closes this Friday at 5:00 PM. Over 1,200 Hooked Media employees have already confirmed their elections. If we don't hear from you, your current elections will automatically roll over, which may not reflect the plan you want.\n\nReview and confirm your benefits here:\n\n{{.URL}}\n\nHooked Media HR Benefits",
      "html": "<html>\n<body style=\"margin:0; padding:0; background-color:#f1f5f9;\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"background-color:#f1f5f9;\">\n<tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:40px 16px;\">\n\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"600\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:600px; max-width:100%; background-color:#ffffff; border-radius:8px; overflow:hidden; font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n\n\t<tr>\n\t\t<td style=\"background-color:#0f3d3a; padding:22px 32px;\">\n\t\t\t<span style=\"color:#ffffff; font-size:16px; font-weight:bold; letter-spacing:0.04em;\">HOOKED MEDIA CO.</span>\n\t\t\t<span style=\"color:#7fd6c4; font-size:13px; margin-left:10px;\">Human Resources</span>\n\t\t</td>\n\t</tr>\n\n\t<tr>\n\t\t<td style=\"padding:32px 32px 8px;\">\n\t\t\t<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px; font-size:15px; color:#0f172a;\">Hi {{.FirstName}},</p>\n\t\t\t<p style=\"margin:0 0 20px; font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#334155;\">\n\t\t\t\tOpen Enrollment for health, dental, and vision benefits closes <strong>this Friday at 5:00 PM</strong>.\n\t\t\t\tOver 1,200 Hooked Media employees have already confirmed their elections. If we don't hear from you,\n\t\t\t\tyour current elections will automatically roll over, which may not reflect the plan you want.\n\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t</td>\n\t</tr>\n\n\t<tr>\n\t\t<td style=\"padding:0 32px 20px;\">\n\t\t\t<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"background-color:#fff7ed; border-left:4px solid #f59e0b; border-radius:4px;\">\n\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:14px 18px; font-size:13px; color:#92400e;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong>Employee:</strong> {{.FirstName}} {{.LastName}}<br>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong>Deadline:</strong> Friday, 5:00 PM\n\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t</table>\n\t\t</td>\n\t</tr>\n\n\t<tr>\n\t\t<td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:8px 32px 28px;\">\n\t\t\t<a href=\"{{.URL}}\" style=\"background-color:#0f766e; color:#ffffff; text-decoration:none; font-size:14px; font-weight:bold; padding:12px 28px; border-radius:6px; display:inline-block;\">Review My Benefits</a>\n\t\t</td>\n\t</tr>\n\n\t<tr>\n\t\t<td style=\"padding:20px 32px; border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;\">\n\t\t\t<p style=\"margin:0; font-size:11px; color:#94a3b8;\">Hooked Media HR Benefits &middot; Questions? Reply to this email or visit the HR portal.</p>\n\t\t</td>\n\t</tr>\n\n</table>\n{{.Tracker}}\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "attachments": []
    },
    {
      "name": "Hooked Media Docs - Shared Spreadsheet Notification",
      "envelope_sender": "Morgan Reyes <docs-notify@hookedmedia.example>",
      "subject": "Morgan Reyes shared \"Q4 Planning & Budget Review.xlsx\" with you",
      "text": "Hi {{.FirstName}},\n\n{{.From}} shared a spreadsheet with you via Hooked Media Docs: \"Q4 Planning & Budget Review.xlsx\"\n\nView it here:\n\n{{.URL}}\n\nThis link will expire in 7 days.\n\nHooked Media Docs",
      "html": "<html>\n<body style=\"margin:0; padding:0; background-color:#f1f5f9;\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"background-color:#f1f5f9;\">\n<tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:40px 16px;\">\n\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"600\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:600px; max-width:100%; background-color:#ffffff; border-radius:8px; overflow:hidden; font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n\n\t<tr>\n\t\t<td style=\"background-color:#0f3d3a; padding:22px 32px;\">\n\t\t\t<span style=\"color:#ffffff; font-size:16px; font-weight:bold; letter-spacing:0.04em;\">HOOKED MEDIA CO.</span>\n\t\t\t<span style=\"color:#7fd6c4; font-size:13px; margin-left:10px;\">IT &middot; Document Sharing</span>\n\t\t</td>\n\t</tr>\n\n\t<tr>\n\t\t<td style=\"padding:32px 32px 8px;\">\n\t\t\t<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px; font-size:15px; color:#0f172a;\">Hi {{.FirstName}},</p>\n\t\t\t<p style=\"margin:0 0 20px; font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#334155;\">\n\t\t\t\t<strong>{{.From}}</strong> shared a spreadsheet with you via Hooked Media Docs.\n\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t</td>\n\t</tr>\n\n\t<tr>\n\t\t<td style=\"padding:0 32px 20px;\">\n\t\t\t<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"background-color:#f8fafc; border:1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius:6px;\">\n\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:16px 18px; font-size:13px; color:#334155;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t📊 <strong>Q4 Planning &amp; Budget Review.xlsx</strong><br>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"color:#64748b;\">Shared by {{.From}} &middot; Link expires in 7 days</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t</table>\n\t\t</td>\n\t</tr>\n\n\t<tr>\n\t\t<td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:8px 32px 28px;\">\n\t\t\t<a href=\"{{.URL}}\" style=\"background-color:#0f766e; color:#ffffff; text-decoration:none; font-size:14px; font-weight:bold; padding:12px 28px; border-radius:6px; display:inline-block;\">View Document</a>\n\t\t</td>\n\t</tr>\n\n\t<tr>\n\t\t<td style=\"padding:20px 32px; border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;\">\n\t\t\t<p style=\"margin:0; font-size:11px; color:#94a3b8;\">Hooked Media Docs &middot; This is an automated sharing notification. Forwarded from a personal account? Verify with the sender before signing in.</p>\n\t\t</td>\n\t</tr>\n\n</table>\n{{.Tracker}}\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "attachments": []
    }
